    "editorial_evidence": [
      "Pinned Macula SBLGNT Mt 27:61 n40027061009 ἄλλη A-NSF and Mt 28:1 n40028001015 ἄλλη A-NSF; exact source occurrences assigned in frozen ACAI to person:Marymagdalene and person:Mary.2",
      "Matthew 27:61 names Mary Magdalene and the other Mary as different women; 28:1 repeats the same distinction",
      "https://biblehub.com/interlinear/matthew/27-61.htm",
      "https://biblehub.com/interlinear/matthew/28-1.htm"
    ],
    "editorial_reason": "Matthew 27:61 and 28:1 each distinguish Mary Magdalene from the other Mary. The singular Greek adjective ἄλλη ('other') at both exact tokens qualifies Mary.2 (the mother of James/Joses), not Mary Magdalene. Preserve Magdalene's separate explicit name instances, both original references and the other Mary's inherited candidates; remove only two false Magdalene pronoun-word associations.",
    "review_status": "editorially_reviewed",
